# Take the direnvrc from the installed devenv, so it stays in step with it. A pinned copy
# goes stale: older ones load the shell via `print-dev-env`, which skips devenv's tasks,
# so `.pre-commit-config.yaml` and the git hooks never get (re)installed.
eval "$(devenv direnvrc)"
use devenv
#use sops
